# The hotspot's password: every deck's, for the network it becomes when it
# finds no Wi-Fi (README.md). In the repo on purpose: it guards a debug
# network that only exists when the deck has no other, and whoever stands at
# the deck needs it without the repo to hand (the Diagnostics page shows it).
# Anyone who reads this can join that network, so ssh on a deck takes keys
# only (../fresh-install.md, "Access").
#
# Read by pi-qemu/deploy/002_system.sh (a dev deck's profile) and by
# `pi-qemu release card` (a release card's).
HOTSPOT_PASSWORD='trimixxx-debug-Kmj3Df'
